  "ruleText": "Frl 308.01 Eye Procurement. In accordance with RSA 325:31-a, an individual desiring to perform eye procurement shall successfully complete a course of training acceptable to a procurement organization as defined in RSA 291-A:2, XX.\n\nSource. #2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88, EXPIRED: 1-20-94\n\nNew. #9716, eff 5-17-10; ss by #12673, eff 11-20-18",
